@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "auto.provisioning"

Feature:  Auto Provisioning
	Testing to assure auto provisioning works properly. Testing that project messages are properly sent as workflow tasks and workflow tasks can be moved through their process accordingly

Teardown:
	* I wait for "10" seconds
	* I log out and log into the support homepage as "amos.fong@liferay.com.broken" with password "test"
	* I tear down the projects with the following project codes
	| PROVISPROVIS |
	* I tear down the projects with the following project names
	| Provis - ${staticProjectName} |

Scenario: Create project
	Testing the ability to create a project using RabbitMQ auto provisioning

	Given I log into the support homepage as "amos.fong@liferay.com.broken" with password "test"
	And I go to the RabbitMQ section of OSB Admin
	And I generate several static variables for Provisioning
	And I generate a provisioning company name
	And I generate a provisioning project name
	And I publish a DXP project RabbitMQ message with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
	| Account Name                           | Provis - ${staticCompanyName}              |
	| Address City                           | Diamond Bar                                |
	| Address Country                        | United States                              |
	| Address Postal Code                    | 91765                                      |
	| Address Region                         | California                                 |
	| Address Street                         | 456 Fake Street                            |
	| Contact Email Address                  | amos.fong@liferay.com.broken               |
	| Contact First Name                     | Amos                                       |
	| Contact Last Name                      | Fong                                       |
	| Dossiera Account Key                   | ${staticDossieraAccountKey}                |
	| Dossiera Address Key 1                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey1}               |
	| Dossiera Address Key 2                 | ${staticDossieraAddressKey2}               |
	| Dossiera Contact Key                   | ${staticDossieraContactKey}                |
	| Dossiera Project Key                   | ${staticDossieraProjectKey}                |
	| End Day                                | ${staticEndDay}                            |
	| End Month                              | ${staticEndMonth}                          |
	| End Year                               | ${staticEndYear}                           |
	| Industry                               | Engineering                                |
	| Owner Email Address                    | amos.fong@liferay.com.broken               |
	| Owner First Name                       | Amos                                       |
	| Owner Last Name                        | Fong                                       |
	| Partner First Line Support             | false                                      |
	| Partner Dossiera Key                   | abcdefgh1234567890                         |
	| Partner Name                           | Zen OSB Partner                            |
	| Partner Support Level                  | Platinum                                   |
	| Product Type                           | New                                        |
	| Project Name                           | Provis - ${staticProjectName}              |
	| Renewal                                | false                                      |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Key             | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityKey}          |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 1 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey1} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Line Item Key 2 | ${staticSalesforceOpportunityLineItemKey2} |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Sold By         | Liferay US                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Stage Name      | Closed Won                                 |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Territory       | United States                              |
	| Salesforce Opportunity Type            | New Business                               |
	| Salesforce Owner User Key              | ${staticSalesforceOwnerUserKey}            |
	| Salesforce Project Key                 | ${staticSalesforceProjectKey}              |
	| Start Day                              | ${staticStartDay}                          |
	| Start Month                            | ${staticStartMonth}                        |
	| Start Year                             | ${staticStartYear}                         |
	| Support Level                          | Platinum                                   |
	| Version Number                         | 7.1                                        |
	And I go to My Workflow Tasks
	And I go to the Other Assignees tab
	And I search for and go to the Workflow Asset titled "Provis - ${staticProjectName}" using the following parameters
	| Match            | All                           |
	| Project Name     | Provis - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Assignee Type    | Role                          |
	| Completed        | No                            |
	| Opportunity Type | New Business                  |
	Then the workflow asset title should have the value "Provis - ${staticProjectName}"
	And the workflow asset header should have the value "New Business"
	And I should be able to view the project summary with the following values
	| Opportunity Stage          | Closed Won                                                    |
	| Code                       | PROVISPROVIS                                                  |
	| Industry                   | Engineering                                                   |
	| Partner                    | Zen OSB Partner                                               |
	| Partner First Line Support | False                                                         |
	| Support Regions            | US                                                            |
	| Support Languages          | English                                                       |
	| Start Date                 | ${staticStartMonthName} ${staticStartDay}, ${staticStartYear} |
	And I should be able to view the offering details with the product "Digital Enterprise Production" with the following values
	| Product          | Digital Enterprise Production                           |
	| Licenses         | True                                                    |
	| License Lifetime | Indefinite                                              |
	| Support Tickets  | True                                                    |
	| SLA              | Platinum                                                |
	| Version          | 7                                                       |
	| Sizing           | Sizing 1                                                |
	| Quantity         | 1                                                       |
	When I assign the Workflow asset titled "Provis - ${staticProjectName}" to myself
	And I go to My Workflow Tasks
	And I go to the Other Assignees tab
	And I search for and go to the Workflow Asset titled "Provis - ${staticProjectName}" using the following parameters
	| Match            | All                           |
	| Project Name     | Provis - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Assignee Type    | User                          |
	| Completed        | No                            |
	| Opportunity Type | New Business                  |
	And I approve the Workflow asset titled "Provis - ${staticProjectName}"
	And I go to the OSB admin main page
	Then I should be able to view a project with the name "Provis - ${staticProjectName}" and following values
	| Status                     | Approved                      |
	| Dossiera Account Key       | ${staticDossieraAccountKey}   |
	| Dossiera Account Name      | Provis - ${staticCompanyName} |
	| Name                       | Provis - ${staticProjectName} |
	| Code                       | PROVISPROVIS                  |
	| Type                       | Group                         |
	| Industry                   | Engineering                   |
	| Partner Code               | Zen OSB Partner               |
	| Partner First Line Support | false                         |
	| Tier                       | Regular                       |
	| Max Contacts               | 10                            |
	| Address Line               | 456 Fake Street               |
	| Country                    | United States                 |
	| State                      | California                    |
	| City                       | Diamond Bar                   |
	| Zip                        | 91765                         |
	And I should be able to view a project offering for the project "Provis - ${staticProjectName}" with a product name "Digital Enterprise Production" and the following values
	| Status           | Active                        |
	| Type             | Regular                       |
	| Product          | Digital Enterprise Production |
	| SLA              | Platinum                      |
	| Start Date       | Today                         |
	| Version          | 7                             |
	| Instance Size    | Sizing 1                      |
	| Licenses         | 0 / 1                         |
	| Tickets          | Unlimited                     |
	And the user with the email address "amos.fong@liferay.com.broken" should be a worker on the project with the name "Provis - ${staticProjectName}"

